WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.502
- ALL RIGHT, FELLAS,
COMING TO THE STAGE NEXT

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:05.938
IS THE BEAUTIFUL GALAXY.

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:09.141
- HEY, BABY.
- HEY, BABY.

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:11.611
♪ ♪

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:13.646
OH.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.314
♪ ♪

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:18.217
GON' BE FOR YOU.
[chuckles]

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:19.485
YOU CAN KEEP IT.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:21.287
THERE'S MORE
WHERE THAT CAME FROM TOO.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.289
TRUST ME.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:24.757
- [whistles]

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:27.426
THERE'S MY GIRL.
OH, DAMN.

00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:29.895
I'M STRAIGHT UP TALKIN' 'BOUT
SOME DARRYL DAWKINS RIGHT HERE,

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:30.896
BECAUSE THIS
SOME CHOCOLATE THUNDER.

00:00:30.896 --> 00:00:32.798
WHAT, GIRL?
MAKE IT RAIN!

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:34.500
[laughs]
YEAH.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.002
OH, YEAH, GIRL.
- I TRY TO MAKE IT LAST!

00:00:37.002 --> 00:00:39.005
[laughs]

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:41.707
- [mutters]
WHAT--

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.075
ALL RIGHT, GIRL, MMM.

00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:45.078
SHA-PAM! I'MA GET IT
RIGHT IN THE BOOTY RIGHT THERE.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.445
UH, AND BOOTY-SWAM!

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:47.980
THAT'S WHAT YOU CALL
A BOOTY INVESTMENT.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.649
[laughs]
SHA-BLAM!

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:52.785
- BUT YOU REALLY DON'T NEED
TO GIVE 'EM THAT MUCH.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.320
I DON'T THINK
THEY'RE EXPECTING ALL THAT.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.289
- WHOO!

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.157
- IT'S KIND OF LIKE
FEEDING A SQUIRREL, YOU KNOW?

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:00.226
I MEAN, THEY WILL
COME BACK TO YOU, SO--

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.428
- OH, OH, OH, MY GOSH.
SOME OF THIS IS GETTING LOST.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:03.663
LET'S GET IT RIGHT
WHERE IT NEEDS TO BE.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.432
RIGHT IN THERE, BABY. OH, YEAH.
- KEEP IT CLASSY.

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.234
- HA HA HA!
- KEEP IT CLASSY.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.735
- OH, [bleep], SOMEBODY
BETTER GET A UMBRELLA,

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:11.070
'CAUSE I CAN'T STOP
MAKING IT RAIN.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.604
IT'S LIKE NOAH'S FLOOD
UP IN HERE.

00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:16.642
WHOO, TWO BY TWO, BABY.
TWO BY TWO! HA HA!

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:18.378
BABY, YOU DON'T KNOW
THAT I'M THE GENERAL,

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.646
'CAUSE IT'S STORMIN' NORMAN.
THAT'S WHAT THEY BE CALLING ME.

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:28.588
[Velcro slowly tearing]

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.189
AHH.
- DAMN.

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:32.792
ANYWAY, LIKE I SAID,
WHEN YOU FINISH TRAINING,

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:34.627
WE'LL GET SCOTTY MUSSO
UP IN HERE.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.963
THAT [bleep]
CAN TRAIN A BOXER.

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.505
[laughs]
OOH, LORD HAVE MERCY.

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:48.074
YOU DON'T KNOW NOTHING
ABOUT THIS. [laughs]

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:50.176
- MAKE IT RAIN!

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.711
- AAH!
- WHAT THE--

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.145
- ARE YOU AN IDIOT?

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:55.981
LEON,
GET THIS GUY OUTTA HERE.

00:01:55.981 --> 00:01:58.918
- ALL RIGHT, NOBODY MOVE!
THERE HE IS.

00:01:58.918 --> 00:01:59.985
- THERE WHO IS?

00:01:59.985 --> 00:02:01.487
- YOU, ON YOUR FEET!
- WHAT?

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:04.123
- ON YOUR FEET.
- WHAT I DO?

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:06.559
- YOU'RE UNDER ARREST
FOR PHOTOCOPYING MONEY.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.595
- OH, GODDAMN IT!

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:11.397
YOU KNOW HOW LONG IT TOOK ME
TO CUT ALL THAT OUT?

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:14.133
I GOT CARPAL TUNNEL SYNDROME
UP IN THIS BITCH,

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.236
CALLUSES ON THE INSIDE
OF MY THUMBS.

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:17.871
- THAT'S DEFINITELY REAL,
THOUGH.

